      "style": { "fontSize": "40px", "fontWeight": 600, "lineHeight": 1.1, "color": "#1d1d1f", "margin": 0, "marginBottom": "48px", "textAlign": "center" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-concepts-inner",
      "component": "box",
      "style": { "maxWidth": "680px", "width": "100%" },
      "spacing": 0,
      "children": [
        "guide-c1-title", "guide-c1-desc", "guide-c1-code",
        "guide-c1-divider",
        "guide-c2-title", "guide-c2-desc", "guide-c2-code",
        "guide-c2-divider",
        "guide-c3-title", "guide-c3-desc", "guide-c3-code1", "guide-c3-code2-label", "guide-c3-code2",
        "guide-c3-divider",
        "guide-c4-title", "guide-c4-desc", "guide-c4-code", "guide-c4-alert",
        "guide-c4-divider",
        "guide-c5-title", "guide-c5-desc", "guide-c5-code1-label", "guide-c5-code1", "guide-c5-code2-label", "guide-c5-code2",
        "guide-c5-divider",
        "guide-c6-title", "guide-c6-desc", "guide-c6-code", "guide-c6-alert"
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": "guide-c1-title",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "title",
      "content": "components 数组",
      "style": { "fontSize": "21px", "fontWeight": 600, "lineHeight": 1.19, "color": "#1d1d1f", "margin": 0, "marginBottom": "8px" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-c1-desc",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "所有组件平铺在一个数组里，通过 id 互相引用。children 数组建立父子关系，SchemaRenderer 从 root 开始递归渲染。",
      "style": { "fontSize": "17px", "fontWeight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.47, "color": "#86868b", "margin": 0, "marginBottom": "16px" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-c1-code",
      "component": "box",
      "style": { "backgroundColor": "#1d1d1f", "borderRadius": "12px", "padding": "20px" },
      "children": ["guide-c1-code-text"]
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-c1-code-text",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "\"components\": [\n  { \"id\": \"root\", \"component\": \"box\",\n    \"children\": [\"title\", \"desc\"] },\n  { \"id\": \"title\", \"component\": \"typography\",\n    \"type\": \"title\", \"content\": \"Hello\" },\n  { \"id\": \"desc\", \"component\": \"typography\",\n    \"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"World\" }\n]",
      "style": { "fontSize": "14px", "fontWeight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.6, "color": "#e0e0e0", "margin": 0, "fontFamily": "ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Monaco, 'Cascadia Code', monospace", "whiteSpace": "pre" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-c1-divider",
      "component": "divider",
      "style": { "margin": "32px 0" }
    },

    {
      "id": "guide-c2-title",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "title",
      "content": "dataModel 与数据绑定",
      "style": { "fontSize": "21px", "fontWeight": 600, "lineHeight": 1.19, "color": "#1d1d1f", "margin": 0, "marginBottom": "8px" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-c2-desc",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "dataModel 是全局状态树。组件通过 value: { path: \"/xxx\" } 实现双向绑定 — 用户输入自动写回 dataModel，其他组件实时响应变化。",
      "style": { "fontSize": "17px", "fontWeight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.47, "color": "#86868b", "margin": 0, "marginBottom": "16px" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-c2-code",
      "component": "box",
      "style": { "backgroundColor": "#1d1d1f", "borderRadius": "12px", "padding": "20px" },
      "children": ["guide-c2-code-text"]
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-c2-code-text",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "// 输入框绑定到 dataModel\n{ \"component\": \"input\",\n  \"value\": { \"path\": \"/user/name\" } }\n\n// dataModel 初始值\n\"dataModel\": { \"user\": { \"name\": \"\" } }",
      "style": { "fontSize": "14px", "fontWeight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.6, "color": "#e0e0e0", "margin": 0, "fontFamily": "ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Monaco, 'Cascadia Code', monospace", "whiteSpace": "pre" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-c2-divider",
      "component": "divider",
      "style": { "margin": "32px 0" }
    },

    {
      "id": "guide-c3-title",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "title",
      "content": "表达式引擎 $​{}",
      "style": { "fontSize": "21px", "fontWeight": 600, "lineHeight": 1.19, "color": "#1d1d1f", "margin": 0, "marginBottom": "8px" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-c3-desc",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "任何字符串属性都支持 $​{} 表达式。通过 $root 访问全局数据，$current 访问 Repeater 当前项，$parent 访问父数组。表达式在安全沙箱中运行。",
      "style": { "fontSize": "17px", "fontWeight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.47, "color": "#86868b", "margin": 0, "marginBottom": "16px" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-c3-code1",
      "component": "box",
      "style": { "backgroundColor": "#1d1d1f", "borderRadius": "12px", "padding": "20px", "marginBottom": "12px" },
      "children": ["guide-c3-code1-text"]
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-c3-code1-text",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "// 模板文本\n\"content\": \"Hello, $​{$root.user.name}!\"",
      "style": { "fontSize": "14px", "fontWeight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.6, "color": "#e0e0e0", "margin": 0, "fontFamily": "ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Monaco, 'Cascadia Code', monospace", "whiteSpace": "pre" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-c3-code2-label",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "条件样式 — 表达式可以用在 style 的值里：",
      "style": { "fontSize": "14px", "fontWeight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.43, "color": "#86868b", "margin": 0, "marginBottom": "8px" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-c3-code2",
      "component": "box",
      "style": { "backgroundColor": "#1d1d1f", "borderRadius": "12px", "padding": "20px" },
      "children": ["guide-c3-code2-text"]
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-c3-code2-text",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "\"color\": \"$​{$root.count > 10\n  ? '#34c759'\n  : '#86868b'}\"",
      "style": { "fontSize": "14px", "fontWeight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.6, "color": "#e0e0e0", "margin": 0, "fontFamily": "ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Monaco, 'Cascadia Code', monospace", "whiteSpace": "pre" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-c3-divider",
      "component": "divider",
      "style": { "margin": "32px 0" }
    },

    {
      "id": "guide-c4-title",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "title",
      "content": "Action 体系",
      "style": { "fontSize": "21px", "fontWeight": 600, "lineHeight": 1.19, "color": "#1d1d1f", "margin": 0, "marginBottom": "8px" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-c4-desc",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "on_tap 触发动作链，支持 update_data（更新数据）、message（消息提示）、notification（通知）、http_proxy（HTTP 请求）等。多个 action 按数组顺序依次执行。",
      "style": { "fontSize": "17px", "fontWeight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.47, "color": "#86868b", "margin": 0, "marginBottom": "16px" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-c4-code",
      "component": "box",
      "style": { "backgroundColor": "#1d1d1f", "borderRadius": "12px", "padding": "20px", "marginBottom": "16px" },
      "children": ["guide-c4-code-text"]
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-c4-code-text",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "\"on_tap\": [\n  { \"action\": \"update_data\",\n    \"path\": \"/count\",\n    \"value\": \"$​{$root.count + 1}\" },\n  { \"action\": \"message\",\n    \"payload\": {\n      \"type\": \"success\",\n      \"content\": \"计数 +1\"\n    } }\n]",
      "style": { "fontSize": "14px", "fontWeight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.6, "color": "#e0e0e0", "margin": 0, "fontFamily": "ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Monaco, 'Cascadia Code', monospace", "whiteSpace": "pre" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-c4-alert",
      "component": "alert",
      "status": "warning",
      "title": "on_tap 只有 Button 和 FloatButton 支持。Typography 等组件设置 on_tap 不会生效。",
      "showIcon": true,
      "style": { "borderRadius": "12px" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-c4-divider",
      "component": "divider",
      "style": { "margin": "32px 0" }
    },

    {
      "id": "guide-c5-title",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "title",
      "content": "条件渲染 Condition",
      "style": { "fontSize": "21px", "fontWeight": 600, "lineHeight": 1.19, "color": "#1d1d1f", "margin": 0, "marginBottom": "8px" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-c5-desc",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "两种模式：when/then/else 做布尔判断，match/cases 做多值分支。切换时可配置过渡动画。",
      "style": { "fontSize": "17px", "fontWeight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.47, "color": "#86868b", "margin": 0, "marginBottom": "16px" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-c5-code1-label",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "布尔判断：",
      "style": { "fontSize": "14px", "fontWeight": 600, "lineHeight": 1.43, "color": "#1d1d1f", "margin": 0, "marginBottom": "8px" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-c5-code1",
      "component": "box",
      "style": { "backgroundColor": "#1d1d1f", "borderRadius": "12px", "padding": "20px", "marginBottom": "16px" },
      "children": ["guide-c5-code1-text"]
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-c5-code1-text",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "text",
