    {
      "id": "guide-c6-title",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "title",
      "content": "列表渲染 Repeater",
      "style": { "fontSize": "21px", "fontWeight": 600, "lineHeight": 1.19, "color": "#1d1d1f", "margin": 0, "marginBottom": "8px" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-c6-desc",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "Repeater 遍历数组数据，为每一项渲染子组件模板。$current 访问当前项数据，keyField 指定唯一标识字段以优化渲染性能。",
      "style": { "fontSize": "17px", "fontWeight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.47, "color": "#86868b", "margin": 0, "marginBottom": "16px" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-c6-code",
      "component": "box",
      "style": { "backgroundColor": "#1d1d1f", "borderRadius": "12px", "padding": "20px", "marginBottom": "16px" },
      "children": ["guide-c6-code-text"]
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-c6-code-text",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "{ \"component\": \"repeater\",\n  \"data\": { \"path\": \"/todos\" },\n  \"keyField\": \"id\",\n  \"children\": [\"todo-item\"] }\n\n// 子模板中用 $current\n{ \"id\": \"todo-item\",\n  \"component\": \"typography\",\n  \"content\": \"$​{$current.text}\" }",
      "style": { "fontSize": "14px", "fontWeight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.6, "color": "#e0e0e0", "margin": 0, "fontFamily": "ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Monaco, 'Cascadia Code', monospace", "whiteSpace": "pre" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-c6-alert",
      "component": "alert",
      "status": "warning",
      "title": "Repeater 内删除操作必须用字段值比较（如 x.id !== $current.id），不能用引用比较（item !== $current），因为 data store 更新时会浅拷贝对象。",
      "showIcon": true,
      "style": { "borderRadius": "12px" }
    },

