      "component": "typography",
      "type": "title",
      "content": "响应式布局",
      "style": { "fontSize": "21px", "fontWeight": 600, "lineHeight": 1.19, "color": "#ffffff", "margin": 0, "marginBottom": "8px" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-a1-desc",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "Row/Col 栅格系统，支持 xs / sm / md / lg / xl / xxl 六个断点。Col 的 span 值为 1-24，自动换行。",
      "style": { "fontSize": "17px", "fontWeight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.47, "color": "#86868b", "margin": 0, "marginBottom": "16px" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-a1-code",
      "component": "box",
      "style": { "backgroundColor": "#1d1d1f", "borderRadius": "12px", "padding": "20px" },
      "children": ["guide-a1-code-text"]
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-a1-code-text",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "{ \"component\": \"row\", \"gutter\": [16, 16],\n  \"children\": [\"col-1\", \"col-2\", \"col-3\"] }\n\n// 每列：桌面 8 格，平板 12 格，手机 24 格\n{ \"component\": \"col\",\n  \"xs\": 24, \"md\": 12, \"lg\": 8,\n  \"children\": [\"card\"] }",
      "style": { "fontSize": "14px", "fontWeight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.6, "color": "#e0e0e0", "margin": 0, "fontFamily": "ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Monaco, 'Cascadia Code', monospace", "whiteSpace": "pre" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-a1-divider",
      "component": "divider",
      "style": { "margin": "32px 0", "borderColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.12)" }
    },

    {
      "id": "guide-a2-title",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "title",
      "content": "动画系统",
      "style": { "fontSize": "21px", "fontWeight": 600, "lineHeight": 1.19, "color": "#ffffff", "margin": 0, "marginBottom": "8px" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-a2-desc",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "6 种内置预设：fade / slideUp / slideDown / slideLeft / slideRight / zoom。安装 framer-motion 后自动启用物理弹簧动画。",
      "style": { "fontSize": "17px", "fontWeight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.47, "color": "#86868b", "margin": 0, "marginBottom": "16px" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-a2-code1",
      "component": "box",
      "style": { "backgroundColor": "#1d1d1f", "borderRadius": "12px", "padding": "20px", "marginBottom": "12px" },
      "children": ["guide-a2-code1-text"]
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-a2-code1-text",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "// 简写 — 使用预设名\n\"animation\": \"fade\"",
      "style": { "fontSize": "14px", "fontWeight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.6, "color": "#e0e0e0", "margin": 0, "fontFamily": "ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Monaco, 'Cascadia Code', monospace", "whiteSpace": "pre" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-a2-code2-label",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "带参数的完整写法：",
      "style": { "fontSize": "14px", "fontWeight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.43, "color": "#86868b", "margin": 0, "marginBottom": "8px" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-a2-code2",
      "component": "box",
      "style": { "backgroundColor": "#1d1d1f", "borderRadius": "12px", "padding": "20px" },
      "children": ["guide-a2-code2-text"]
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-a2-code2-text",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "\"animation\": {\n  \"preset\": \"slideUp\",\n  \"duration\": 0.6,\n  \"delay\": 0.2\n}",
      "style": { "fontSize": "14px", "fontWeight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.6, "color": "#e0e0e0", "margin": 0, "fontFamily": "ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Monaco, 'Cascadia Code', monospace", "whiteSpace": "pre" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-a2-divider",
      "component": "divider",
      "style": { "margin": "32px 0", "borderColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.12)" }
    },

    {
      "id": "guide-a3-title",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "title",
      "content": "表单校验",
      "style": { "fontSize": "21px", "fontWeight": 600, "lineHeight": 1.19, "color": "#ffffff", "margin": 0, "marginBottom": "8px" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-a3-desc",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "Form 容器管理校验状态。给输入组件配置 rules 数组，通过 submitButtonId 关联提交按钮 — 校验不通过时按钮自动禁用。",
      "style": { "fontSize": "17px", "fontWeight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.47, "color": "#86868b", "margin": 0, "marginBottom": "16px" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-a3-code",
      "component": "box",
      "style": { "backgroundColor": "#1d1d1f", "borderRadius": "12px", "padding": "20px" },
      "children": ["guide-a3-code-text"]
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-a3-code-text",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "{ \"component\": \"form\",\n  \"submitButtonId\": \"submit-btn\",\n  \"children\": [\"email-input\", \"submit-btn\"] }\n\n{ \"id\": \"email-input\",\n  \"component\": \"input\",\n  \"label\": \"邮箱\",\n  \"rules\": [\n    { \"required\": true,\n      \"message\": \"请输入邮箱\" },\n    { \"type\": \"email\",\n      \"message\": \"邮箱格式不正确\" }\n  ] }",
      "style": { "fontSize": "14px", "fontWeight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.6, "color": "#e0e0e0", "margin": 0, "fontFamily": "ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Monaco, 'Cascadia Code', monospace", "whiteSpace": "pre" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-a3-divider",
      "component": "divider",
      "style": { "margin": "32px 0", "borderColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.12)" }
    },

    {
      "id": "guide-a4-title",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "title",
      "content": "样式系统",
      "style": { "fontSize": "21px", "fontWeight": 600, "lineHeight": 1.19, "color": "#ffffff", "margin": 0, "marginBottom": "8px" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-a4-desc",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "双轨制：style 对象用于精确值和动态表达式，className 字符串用于 Tailwind 工具类、响应式和 hover 状态。两者可以同时使用。",
      "style": { "fontSize": "17px", "fontWeight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.47, "color": "#86868b", "margin": 0, "marginBottom": "16px" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-a4-code",
      "component": "box",
      "style": { "backgroundColor": "#1d1d1f", "borderRadius": "12px", "padding": "20px" },
      "children": ["guide-a4-code-text"]
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-a4-code-text",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "// style — 精确值 + 动态表达式\n\"style\": {\n  \"padding\": \"16px\",\n  \"color\": \"$​{$root.active ? '#0066cc' : '#86868b'}\"\n}\n\n// className — Tailwind + 响应式 + hover\n\"className\": \"rounded-xl hover:shadow-lg\n  transition-shadow md:p-8 p-4\"",
      "style": { "fontSize": "14px", "fontWeight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.6, "color": "#e0e0e0", "margin": 0, "fontFamily": "ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Monaco, 'Cascadia Code', monospace", "whiteSpace": "pre" }
    },

