      "style": { "fontSize": "40px", "fontWeight": 600, "lineHeight": 1.1, "color": "#1d1d1f", "margin": 0, "marginBottom": "48px", "textAlign": "center" }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-faq-collapse",
      "component": "collapse",
      "style": { "maxWidth": "680px", "width": "100%", "backgroundColor": "transparent" },
      "options": [
        { "label": "faui 支持哪些 React 版本？", "value": "react", "children": ["guide-faq-a1"] },
        { "label": "必须用 Ant Design 吗？", "value": "antd", "children": ["guide-faq-a2"] },
        { "label": "动画需要额外安装什么？", "value": "animation", "children": ["guide-faq-a3"] },
        { "label": "表达式里能调用自定义函数吗？", "value": "expression", "children": ["guide-faq-a4"] },
        { "label": "如何自定义组件注册？", "value": "custom", "children": ["guide-faq-a5"] },
        { "label": "Schema 的 id 有什么命名规范？", "value": "naming", "children": ["guide-faq-a6"] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-faq-a1",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "React 18 及以上版本。faui 使用了 React 18 的并发特性，不支持 React 17 及更早版本。",
      "style": { "fontSize": "15px", "fontWeight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.6, "color": "#86868b", "margin": 0 }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-faq-a2",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "是的，faui 的 full 版本基于 Ant Design 组件库。antd 和 dayjs 是 peer dependency，需要一起安装。",
      "style": { "fontSize": "15px", "fontWeight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.6, "color": "#86868b", "margin": 0 }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-faq-a3",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "faui 内置了 CSS transition 动画，无需额外安装。如果需要更丰富的物理弹簧动画效果，可以安装 framer-motion — faui 会自动检测并启用。",
      "style": { "fontSize": "15px", "fontWeight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.6, "color": "#86868b", "margin": 0 }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-faq-a4",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "表达式在安全沙箱中运行，不能直接调用外部函数。但你可以通过 dataModel 传入计算好的值，或者使用 Action 体系中的 http_proxy 调用后端接口。",
      "style": { "fontSize": "15px", "fontWeight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.6, "color": "#86868b", "margin": 0 }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-faq-a5",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "通过 ComponentRegistry 注册自定义组件。创建一个 React 组件，然后调用 registry.register('my-component', MyComponent) 即可在 schema 中使用。",
      "style": { "fontSize": "15px", "fontWeight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.6, "color": "#86868b", "margin": 0 }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-faq-a6",
      "component": "typography",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "id 在整个 schema 中必须唯一。建议使用 kebab-case 命名（如 user-profile-card），并按页面或模块加前缀避免冲突（如 home-hero-title）。",
      "style": { "fontSize": "15px", "fontWeight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.6, "color": "#86868b", "margin": 0 }
    }
  ],
